-- Story 20.8 print — combined-order + nested-list geometry fixture. Adds a Schedule 8 (Tree to
-- Truck) page to mill 517/2021, the mill the combined Print Schedules IT (allSchedules on 517)
-- already renders every other in-scope section from. This pins TWO things the single-schedule 576
-- fixture cannot:
--   1. BR-08 position — with 517 now carrying Schedule 8 data, the combined PDF proves Schedule 8
--      sorts between Schedule 7B and Schedule 9 (PrintScheduleIT#allSchedules_rendersEveryInScopeSection).
--   2. The deep three-level geometry — the ONE construct with no precedent in the sibling templates:
--      a page with 2+ samples, one of which has 3 additions AND 3 deductions, so the additions inner
--      <list> stretches and floats the deductions block down inside the fixed-height samples list cell.
