-- rows already exist (V2 + the other print fixtures), so only the Tree-to-Truck hierarchy is added.
-- Tree-to-Truck PK ids 885x/886x/887x are unused in the TREE_TO_TRUCK_* tables (V22/V23 use
-- 850x/851x/86xx/870x/88[0-1]x).

